Common EducationOrganizationIndicator
    documentation "An indicator or metric of an Education Organization."
    descriptor Indicator
        documentation "The name or code for the indicator or metric."
        is part of identity
    shared string DesignatedBy
        documentation "The person, organization, or department that defined the metric."
        is optional
    shared string Indicator named IndicatorValue
        documentation "The value of the indicator or metric. The semantics of an empty value is ""not submitted."""
        is optional
    descriptor IndicatorLevel
        documentation "The value of the indicator or metric, as a value from a controlled vocabulary. The semantics of an empty value is ""not submitted."""
        is optional
    descriptor IndicatorGroup
        documentation "The name for a group of indicators."
        is optional
    common Period
        documentation "The time period or as-of date for the indicator."
        is optional collection
